<title>PAKISTAN: Shell Pakistan rises 2.17 percent.</title>
<headline>Shell Pakistan rises 2.17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Pakistan Ltd 10-rupee stock rose 5.00 rupees, or 2.17 percent, to 235 on Thursday at the Karachi Stock Exchange on hopes the company will post good results for the year ending in June, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some 1,300 shares changed hands in early trade as the stock gradually moved up during the last few sessions, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Fresh buying followed an announcement of the company's first half results to December which showed an after-tax profit of 379 million rupees, or 271 percent up, compared to the year-ago net profit of 102 million. -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
